TENDL-2017 (TALYS Evaluated Nuclear Data Library)                 9237 1451   11
                                                                  9237 1451   12
U238 proton general purpose library                               9237 1451   13
                                                                  9237 1451   14
Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         9237 1451   15
                                                                  9237 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning and D. Rochman,                                 9237 1451   17
      Modern nuclear data evaluation with the TALYS code system,  9237 1451   18
